# agentpair:agent — the agent half of timmy's paired posture (IDEA-1090).
#
# Lead partner from the 2026-08-28 gate on the real compendium batch skills:
# qwen3.5:9b-q4_K_M — 12/20 summary repairs with ZERO dropped fact tokens and
# zero hallucinations, 26/30 fence tags, one correct report-instead-of-edit;
# tied with gemma4:e4b on fidelity, preferred for tools + a correct refusal.
# Cohabiting with agentpair:fim as a second runner (5.38 GiB @16K, pair
# 7.9 GiB): FIM TTFT p95 <= 0.30 s under this model's ~9k-token prefill load
# (benchmarks/results/pair-cohab-20260828).
#
# KNOWN CAP: Ollama's server/sched.go forces numParallel=1 for the qwen35
# family (a stale guard for llama.cpp#20222, fixed upstream; ollama#17144
# unblocks it, unmerged as of 2026-08-26). One slot regardless of
# OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL — fine for the single-lane batch agent, not for two
# lanes. agentpair:agent-gemma4-e4b keeps the two-lane option.
#
# THINKING is not suppressed here and cannot be (a Modelfile cannot set think;
# GUARDRAILS.md §1): callers send `think: false` on /api/chat. The gate ran
# with think:false, temperature 0, num_ctx 16384 — that is what is pinned.
#
# REFERENCE COPY. The tag on timmy is built by llama/ollama-configmap.yaml's
# startup.sh (prepare_agent_pair) from this same text; keep the two identical.
# Requires: ollama pull qwen3.5:9b-q4_K_M
# Build:    ollama create agentpair:agent -f agentpair-agent.Modelfile

FROM qwen3.5:9b-q4_K_M

# RENDERER / PARSER deliberately inherited (qwen3.5) — restating them would
# freeze this tag against upstream renderer fixes (same call as
# dotfiles/ollama/qwen36-coding-35b.Modelfile).

# num_ctx baked: a runner is keyed by num_ctx, and a request without one
# reloads at OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH=131072 (5-15 s, evicts the FIM runner at
# 128K KV) — pre-flight S13. 16K is what the gate and the cohabitation leg used.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
# The gate's sampling: temperature 0 on top of the tag's shipped row, pinned
# completely so a base-tag revision cannot move benchmarked behaviour.
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
